source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A double quote in a title is attribute-escaped by Jira and remains one character of the title; jiro escapes it for the Markdown title it writes.
-- input.jira --
[x|http://x|a"b]
-- rendered.html --
<p><a href="http://x" title="a&quot;b" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">x</a></p>
-- want.md --
[x](http://x "a\"b")
-- warnings.json --
[]
